// THESIS: business intent becomes a weekly plan, then a focused social design.
// OWN-WORLD: inherit the Harness shell; live neutral tokens, restrained warm accent, native controls.
// STORY: choose a company, plan a campaign week, create and review one design.
// FIRST VIEWPORT: compact company bar, Home and real work; preview leads editing.
// FORM: Operate extension of existing Harness; no replacement shell or server.
// FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md.
